				<Comment><![CDATA[Axis Homing Status:
0: idle
1: start homing
2: searching home switch
3: stopping on home switch
4: moving off home switch
5: searching sync pulse
6: stopping after homing
]]></Comment>
				<BitSize>32</BitSize>
				<BitOffs>128</BitOffs>
			</SubItem>
			<SubItem>
